    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are proud to present a lovely two bedroom, first floor apartment that is tastefully presented throughout, with a host of attractive features and the benefit of a very convenient location close to Clane village and all amenities. This beautiful apartment would be suitable for first time buyers, those wishing to start taking things easy in life or investors looking for an opportunity to acquire a quality property where rental demand is strong. \nSpace and style go hand in hand with this apartment as it is well presented with, lovely fresh decor, attractive features and finishes adding to its appeal. It boasts a generous living space, kitchen, two bedrooms (1 ensuite) and a bathroom all ensuring this a comfortable, spacious, modern home that will surely impress. \nThe Avenue is conveniently located just a short stroll from Clane village and a host of excellent amenities including shops, schools, church, pubs, cafe's, restaurants, boutiques, a hotel / leisure centre and an array of sports and recreational facilities. For those commuting to work there is a frequent bus service, rail link from Sallins (via shuttle bus) and easy access to both the M4 and M7 motorways. \nThis is undoubtedly an opportunity to acquire a wonderful home / investment in a super, convenient setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.4m x 1.1m\nWith laminate flooring, coved ceiling, radiator cabinet, airing cupboard.\n\nLounge - 7.2m x 3.5m\nWith laminate flooring, coved ceiling, tv point, radiator cabinet, French door to balcony.\n\nKitchen - 2.4m x 2.2m\nWith fitted kitchen, electric oven, hob, fridge/freezer, washer/dryer, tiled floor, tiled splashback.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.2m\nTo back fitted wardrobes, carpet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 2.5m\nTo back with fitted wardrobes, oak flooring, radiator cabinet.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.2m x 1.5m\nWith Triton electric shower, vanity whb, wc, shower screen, tiled floor, tiled walls, mirror, wall mounted electric heater, extractor, insert shelf.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.9m\nWith bath, wc, whb, tiled floor, part tiled walls, extractor, mirror front bathroom cabinet, wall mounted electric heater.\n\nCorridor - 3.5m x 1.0m\nWith laminate flooring, coved ceiling.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Built 2004, </li><li>Floor area 68.88 sq m / 741 sq ft approx,</li><li>Electric heating,</li><li>PVC double glazed windows</li><li>6 panel internal doors</li><li>Wired for alarm</li><li>Curtains poles & lightfittings</li><li>Balcony</li><li>Convenient location</li><li>Adjacent to Westgrove Hotel / gym</li><li>2 parking permit available.</ul>"
      },
